OL,3,GNEWSAGirls to be given right to wear
OL,4,Atrousers in schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FGirls in Northern Ireland are to be
OL,7,Fgiven the legal right to wear trousers
OL,8,Fin school if they wish to do so.
OL,10,FRevising guidelines, Education Minister
OL,11,FPaul Givan said that, from the start of
OL,12,Fthe 2027/2028 academic year, schools
OL,13,Fwill be banned from prohibiting girls
OL,14,Fwearing trousers.
OL,16,FThere are already laws on school
OL,17,Funiform in Northern Ireland, and Givan
OL,18,Fhad previously said they give girls the
OL,19,Flegal authority to challenge their
OL,20,Fschools.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
