OL,3,GNEWSAGirls to be given right to wear
OL,4,Atrousers in schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FMLAs on the Education Committee,
OL,7,Fhowever, had called on the minister to
OL,8,Fgo further and had planned to bring
OL,9,Fforward a single issue bill so that all
OL,10,Fschools give girls the choice.
